# Deny every path by default. scripts/build_docker_context.py creates a fresh
# context containing only these exact release inputs; no source-tree wildcard is
# permitted here.
**

!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!artifacts/
!artifacts/xiaoqing.whl
!requirements/
!requirements/python-3.13-runtime.lock
!config/
!config/config.json.example
!config/secrets.json.example
